# Enter on an empty description, and handing an AI Task's result to a person.
#
# The blank lines below are the point: each one is Enter pressed at a
# "Description:" or "Email address:" prompt, which must leave the field blank
# rather than re-ask. @blank sends one, because a plan file cannot carry an
# empty line of its own.
/reset
yes
/clear
@timeout 300
/enterprise
1
Bellhaven Supplies
Pack and ship customer orders accurately and on time.
@blank
/function
1
Order Preparation
Turn a customer order into the exact picking and packing instructions a person on the floor can follow.
@blank
@staff /staff
/add-human-worker
Warehouse Lead
1
@blank
@note the AI produces the instructions
/task
1
We've just received an order for a ceramic lamp and a teapot. Give me the picking and packing instructions to send to the floor.
1
@wait 150
@note now hand them to the person, without retyping them
/create-human-task
Follow the packing instructions, and record anything that did not match.
2
1
/human-task human-task-1
@note and the person finishes it -- the handover must not try to advance task-1
/complete-human-task
Packed both items, separated with card dividers. Nothing was missing.
/human-tasks
/tasks
